landmarks.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: Nine transparent architectural landmarks for a beautifully produced orange-juice island platformer.
Create EXACTLY a 3 columns by 3 rows sprite atlas with nine independent, completely isolated structures, equal cells, each centered with substantial transparent padding, no overlap. Front-facing orthographic side-game view with only a very slight view of the top surfaces, NOT isometric. Same warm golden upper-left light, teal shadows, exquisite sculpted stylized 3D architecture with hand-painted weathered textures, fine carved details, botanical citrus motifs, cream sandstone, antique brass, deep teal copper, green leaves, orange juice, purple royal banners. No floor plane, no ground shadows, no labels, no text, genuinely transparent background.
Nine cells in strict row order:
1 a small bustling harbour market building, plaster and terracotta, orange cream striped awnings, wooden counters, stacked crates of oranges and a balcony with plants;
2 a lovely cream stone windmill with wooden linen sails, terracotta cap, orange ivy, ladders and a small mill wheel;
3 a tall Roman-style aqueduct with three full arches, carved limestone blocks, brass sluice valve and an orange juice channel;
4 an ornate enormous golden chalice fountain on a carved circular amphitheatre plinth, filled with orange juice pouring in several streams, citrus mosaic details and balustrades;
5 a mysterious octagonal memory archive library, cream columns, teal doors, amber glass jars in tall windows, terracotta domed roof, curling roots;
6 a complex teal-and-brass juice refinery with cylindrical orange-glass tanks, big copper pipes, cogwheels, pistons, gauges, small platforms and railings;
7 a lush citrus conservatory with an arched green trellis, hanging vines, mature orange trees and a carved stone garden doorway;
8 a tall slender cream sandstone bell tower with visible brass bell, teal pyramidal roof, ivy and a rope;
9 Guina's regal fortified palace facade with deep purple banners, brass doors, segmented orange dome, cream fluted towers and teal metal details.
All structures have a crisp coherent crafted look. Fine detail, no simplistic block buildings. Fully visible, no cut-off roof tips or pipes. Transparent RGBA.
